node_modules
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/dist
**/.ponder
# Runtime state the indexer owns. WORKDIR is /app/packages/indexer, which is exactly where the
# default journal path resolves - so a stray .exdate/ in the build context would be read as real
# deliveries by the latency route. compose sets EXDATE_LATENCY_JOURNAL_FILE to the volume, and
# this makes sure there is nothing for it to fall back onto.
**/.exdate
.git
.vercel
.env
.env.*
*.log
